{"id":"wb-8-31","name":"新开流遗址","title":"新开流遗址","status":"catalogue","text":"新开流遗址位于黑龙江省密山市，是全国重点文物保护单位。名录记载的时代为新石器时代，文物类型为古遗址，本条按第八批名录收录。","sourceUrl":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/content/2019-10/16/content_5440577.htm","sourceName":"公布名录","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f98c5d3715d5f056f01d9449.jpg","title":"新开流遗址 骨雕鹰首.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%96%B0%E5%BC%80%E6%B5%81%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80_%E9%AA%A8%E9%9B%95%E9%B9%B0%E9%A6%96.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/%E6%96%B0%E5%BC%80%E6%B5%81%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80_%E9%AA%A8%E9%9B%95%E9%B9%B0%E9%A6%96.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Huanokinhejo","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​骨雕鹰首 新石器时代（距今约6000年） 密山市新开流遗址出土。远古时期渔猎经济，猎鹰海东青占有重要地位。此鹰首顺骨棒雕琢，长嘴圆眼，凌空飞翔状。","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}